          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മൃഗശാല — mṛgaśāla — \"a zoo\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കുട്ടികൾ മൃഗശാലയിൽ സിംഹത്തെ കണ്ടു. kuṭṭikaḷ mṛgaśālayil siṁhatte kaṇṭu. The children saw a lion at the zoo."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മൃഗം, an animal, plus ശാല, a hall or house."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
