          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മൃഗശാല (mṛgaśāla) is a Malayalam compound built from two Sanskrit words, mṛga, \"a wild animal\", and śālā, \"a house, a hall\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
